<div class="page-head"><div class="titles"><h1>Supplier damage claims</h1><p>Prepare the evidence once and keep each delivery under one claim reference.</p></div></div>
<% if(locked){ %><section class="notice"><span class="badge">Pro</span> Damage claims require Pro or Custom. <a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Upgrade</a></section><% } %>
<p>Start from a <a href="/autopilot/delivery-quality">failed physical delivery inspection</a> with an actual damaged-unit count. Pro needs a completed manual example before routine claims. Custom can authorize a bounded scope without training. Short deliveries, tracked or measured goods, portal submissions and settlement decisions need separate review.</p>
<% if(saved){const p=saved.snapshot; %><section class="card section"><h2><%= saved.reference %></h2><p><%= p.supplierName %> · <%= p.poNumber %> · <%= p.product %> · <%= p.damagedQuantity %> damaged <%= p.unit %></p><p>Recorded goods cost: <%= goodsCost %>. The original physical count, photos and purchase order remain the evidence.</p>
<% if(problem){ %><p class="notice"><%= problem %></p><% } %>
<p>To: <%= p.recipient %></p><h3><%= words.subject %></h3><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><%= words.body %></p>
<h3>Selected photo copies</h3><% if(!p.photos.length){ %><p>No photos selected. This email uses the recorded physical findings only.</p><% } %><% for(const photo of p.photos){ %><p><a href="/autopilot/quality-photos/<%= photo.id %>?copy=email">Download email copy</a> · <a href="/autopilot/quality-photos/<%= photo.id %>">Download original</a> <%= photo.caption %></p><% } %>
<% if(delivery){ %><p><strong>Mailbox delivery: <%= delivery.status %></strong> <%= delivery.error_message||'' %> <%= delivery.provider_error||'' %></p><% if(delivery.provider_status==='AMBIGUOUS'){ %><p class="notice">Check the mailbox Sent folder. An uncertain send is never reset or resent automatically.</p><% } %><% } %>
<% if(!problem&&delivery?.status!=='SENT'&&delivery?.provider_status!=='AMBIGUOUS'){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-claims/<%= saved.id %>/send" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="sourceFingerprint" value="<%= saved.source_fingerprint %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I approve this exact recipient, message, damaged quantity, goods value and selected photo copies. This does not approve a credit, write-off, settlement or payment.</label><button class="btn btn--primary" <%= shadow?'disabled':'' %>>Send this claim once</button></form><% } %>
<% if(!problem){ %><section class="section"><h3>Authorize matching routine claims</h3><% if(plan==='pro'&&!manualExampleReady&&!matchingRule?.example_id){ %><p>First send this exact claim with your individual approval. Pro learns only from a completed mailbox acceptance.</p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-claims/<%= saved.id %>/authority" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><% if(matchingRule){ %><input type="hidden" name="ruleId" value="<%= matchingRule.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= matchingRule.revision %>"><% } %><input type="hidden" name="exampleId" value="<%= matchingRule?.example_id||saved.id %>">
<p>This applies only to the supplier, product, receiving location and connected mailbox shown above. Every message checks current plan and authority again.</p>
<label class="rm-field"><span>Maximum damaged units per claim</span><input type="number" name="maxUnits" min="1" max="100000" step="1" required></label>
<label class="rm-field"><span>Maximum recorded goods cost per claim (<%= p.currency %>)</span><input name="maxValue" inputmode="decimal" required></label>
<label class="rm-field"><span>Maximum recorded goods cost per rolling seven days (<%= p.currency %>)</span><input name="maxWeekly" inputmode="decimal" required></label>
<label class="rm-field"><span>Maximum delivery age in days</span><input type="number" name="maxAgeDays" min="1" max="365" step="1" required></label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="includePhotos" value="yes"> Attach up to three saved inspection photo copies. If there are more, ask me to select them.</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I authorize this exact scope and limits. A person still records the physical damage; all settlement and accounting decisions need separate approval.</label>
<button class="btn" <%= !routineReady||plan==='pro'&&!manualExampleReady&&!matchingRule?.example_id?'disabled':'' %>>Authorize bounded routine claims</button></form>
<% if(matchingRule&&routineReady&&!saved.communication_id){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-claims/<%= saved.id %>/routine" class="section"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="ruleId" value="<%= matchingRule.id %>"><button class="btn">Apply current routine authority</button></form><% } %></section><% } %></section><% } %>
<section class="card section"><h2>Recorded claims</h2><% if(!rows.length){ %><p>No claims prepared yet. Open a failed delivery inspection to start.</p><% } %><% for(const r of rows){ %><p><a href="/autopilot/supplier-claims/<%= r.id %>"><%= r.reference %></a> · <%= helpers.dateTime(r.created_at) %></p><% } %></section>
<section class="card section"><h2>Routine scopes</h2><% for(const r of rules){ %><article class="section"><h3><%= r.scope.supplierName %> · <%= r.scope.product %> · <%= r.scope.location %></h3><p><%= r.enabled?'Enabled within current plan and routine authority':'Stopped' %> · up to <%= r.max_units %> damaged units per claim · deliveries up to <%= r.max_age_days %> days old · <%= r.include_photos?'Attach recorded photo copies':'Text-only claims' %></p><p>Recorded goods cost limit: <%= helpers.money(Number(r.max_value_minor),r.currency) %> per claim and <%= helpers.money(Number(r.max_weekly_minor),r.currency) %> per rolling seven days.</p><% if(r.enabled){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-claim-rules/<%= r.id %>/stop"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= r.revision %>"><button class="btn">Stop future claims</button></form><% } %></article><% } %></section><p>AI credits used: 0.</p>
